can2gauge private libraries (PlatformIO picks these up automatically):

  Display_ST7701   2.1" 480x480 ST7701S RGB panel + AL8860 backlight. Init sequences: YouriTech ET021CR01-Z (vendor
                   code, the default) and the Waveshare 2.1 glass (from the UGB firmware, MIT; [env:waveshare])
  CST8xx_Touch     capacitive touch controller on the panel flex
  TCA9554          I2C expander (LCD reset/CS, touch reset, CAN termination FET)
  LVGL_Driver      LVGL 9 display/touch glue, LVGL task + lock
  GaugeUI          the display front end (pages, swipe, menu, alerts, boot logo)
  CANLine          TWAI transport + VAG PQ / OBD-II / OpenHaldex decoders
  KLine            L9637D transport + KWP1281 + KWP2000 stacks
  ME7Logger        ME7Logger-style RAM logging (.ecu/.cfg) over KWP2000
  IOX              TCA9554 P4-P7 outputs + ADS1115 analog inputs
